1
00:00:00,680 --> 00:00:04,119
We knew the world
would not be the same.

2
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:09,119
Few people laughed.

3
00:00:10,020 --> 00:00:11,179
Few people cried.

4
00:00:12,220 --> 00:00:15,559
Most people were silent.

5
00:00:17,140 --> 00:00:21,008
I remembered the line
from the Hindu scripture,

6
00:00:21,020 --> 00:00:23,879
the Bhagavad Gita.

7
00:00:25,720 --> 00:00:26,419
Vishnu

8
00:00:28,840 --> 00:00:34,189
is trying to persuade the
prince that he should do his

9
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:42,288
duty and to impress him, takes
on his multi-armed form and

10
00:00:42,299 --> 00:00:50,448
says, "Now, I am become death,
the destroyer of worlds."

11
00:00:50,459 --> 00:00:53,379
I suppose we all thought
that one way or another.

